DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/workers/domains/{domain_id}
Detaches a domain from a Worker. Both the Worker and all of its previews are no longer routable using this domain.
Required: account_id (path); domain_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/workers/domains/{domain_id}
Gets information about a Worker domain.
Required: account_id (path); domain_id (path)
